{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00abDark times have come, and the horror nurtured by our fears is already at the doorstep\u00bb</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented trials have befallen this place. Only you are capable of eliminating the threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this godforsaken land, find new items for survival, and do not let the blight seep into your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local legend says: Only the vigilant will behold the dawn, while the drowsy will see only eternal darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you capable of enduring the night in this harsh land?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your supplies wisely! The night spares no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.poster.avif?t=1762272622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.webm?t=1762272622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/8b6b76cf915851424d7f10089cec6613.mp4?t=1762272622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find useful items in mysterious locations. Local merchants are eager to trade for the items they\u2019re interested in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows\u2014perhaps one day a small mirror or a modest clock will save your life in a moment of courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/629b2a3b2d25cc353e2fa4837d376d4b.poster.avif?t=1762272622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/629b2a3b2d25cc353e2fa4837d376d4b.webm?t=1762272622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/629b2a3b2d25cc353e2fa4837d376d4b.mp4?t=1762272622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What secrets does this place hold?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While there is still enough time, you must act before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there salvation for this godforsaken place? That is for you to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a.poster.avif?t=1762272622\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a.webm?t=1762272622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/extras/9f9cabc26e17ef02b996c99f2b90452a.mp4?t=1762272622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And remember! Time is working against you. What will the next morning bring?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127340?t=1762272622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127340?t=1762272622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127340/3d6a1364f732e1c4f9181c2f715526a5246fb64c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762272622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama